From 2a8a7cf956c31225740636511d3b04f8452c0cc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:35:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Brief 27's offers and auditions: the actor's side of
 casting, each choice read by what books, pays or casts

Negotiation went through the agent as one ask for a fifth more, answered raised or kept. The actor now picks the term the
agent asks about once (the pay, a recurring part's guaranteed episodes, a promotional film's pay above what the contract
pays for it), and the production's answer is one loop 18 names: given, kept, a trade-off, or the offer withdrawn, a small
chance and more for a bigger ask. Each answer writes the offer's terms, which datesOf, promisedPay, contractFor,
renewFromOption and promoSession read, so the days booked, the pay promised, the next season's rate and the promotional
film's pay follow it. Without an agent nobody asks, as Part 10 says. No part the game offers is paid $25,000, so the
promotional film's ask was widened to what the agreement leaves negotiable below it too, or it could never be pressed.

A self-tape records takes, each its own draw, three a day and eight kept, and the one sent is replayed from what it was
judged from, so casting reads the figure the take showed and only it goes on the work record. The sides are played a way
chosen as a brief's are, read against the part's genre register; at an audition or callback in person played some way,
casting gives the direction the part asks for, the clock stops ten minutes in, and following or keeping the choice judges
the rest. Each was measured winning or losing a callback for one twin and not the other.

A lead from an office that cast the actor before can come on condition of its last round, held and not booked until that
round decides. A part's requirement can change at casting's cut, releasing whoever no longer fits. A part lost or let go
can be recast and posted again, decided afresh. Withdrawing with a day's notice costs nothing; not turning up (asleep or
elsewhere, not ill) or withdrawing later is remembered by the office for two years, halving its cuts and stopping its
direct offers. A chemistry read or screen test moves only if the production agrees, more often with a clash to give.

The logic is in systems/offers.ts; projobs.ts lends it its steps (OFFER_HOOKS) and calls it at small hooks. New state is
optional on the opportunity, the round, the contract and the record, so older saves load with none of it. Every figure
is the game's ASSUMPTION. b20-career-skill's twins now hold different numbers of postings, recasts differing, so their
comparison starts a week later; the wiring list (audit-2026-10-21) is left for the integration to regenerate.

